  "rule_diff": "--- \n+++ \n@@ -226,8 +226,9 @@\n Buyer value: a settled deal is worth the SKU's list price to the order, or 0 if the food did not last\n `use_within_hours` at settle or the goods broke. Surplus = value - price + refund, so broken goods under a\n warranty come to 0 and without one to minus the price. Saved, the part that scores, is the sum over deals of\n-surplus / list price (a deal that served nothing counts -1, or 0 if refunded), divided by deals + 100. A sofa and a\n-snack at 30% off score the same.\n+(list price - price) / (list price - unit cost), the share of the shop's margin kept, at most 1 (a deal that served\n+nothing counts -1, or 0 if refunded), divided by deals + 100 (patch 3.6). A sofa and a snack bought at the same\n+point between cost and list score the same.\n \n Forum votes count when the voter has at least 50 settled deals and a different GitHub owner from the author;\n other votes are kept (`\"counted\": false`) and start counting once the voter reaches 50 deals. `likes`,\n",
